e à n tↄ́ kpáro,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"weé n sáabu kpá mira guuro.","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"Ma m̀bona ma kpasa,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ma mìbↄkↄ è ga kↄ̃n wɛ́ɛ'io,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ma daɛbↄ è yĩi kũ ai guu gá dↄo.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ma wɛ́ɛ kakana kↄ̃n pↄsia ↄ́ↄdↄnao,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"èe gaa kɛ̀ ma ibɛɛnↄↄ pari yãnzi.","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"À gu ma kiia zaakɛrinↄ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"zaakɛ Dii ma ↄ́ↄdↄna mà.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Dii ma wiipɛna mà,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Dii ma aduakɛna sì.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Wí é ma ibɛɛnↄ kũ ń píngi aↄ̃ gↄ̃ bídi guu,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"aↄ̃é fu kãndo aↄ̃ kpɛɛ li.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/bus_sim/PSA/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/bus_sim/PSA/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/bus_sim/PSA/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}